I think I've discovered that the actual problem here is with having the `@TestReactiveTransaction` at the class level. If I keep it to every method I think its fine, unless my `@BeforeEach` or `@AfterEach` method does something that requires a transaction, which I could think of use cases that it might want to (i.e. set up the database in some way before each test runs).

